# Settings for the site. Copy this file to site/.env for local work. Every name
# the site code or its build script reads is here, including the ones a host
# sets, which stay commented out. docs/hosting.md has the hosted values.
#
# Astro puts only PUBLIC_ names in the page. Every other name here stays on the
# machine that runs the build.

# ==== Waitlist (Clerk) =======================================================

# Required for the waitlist form to work. The Publishable Key (pk_test_...) of
# the Clerk development instance, from the API keys page in the Clerk Dashboard.
PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ==== Hosted builds only =====================================================

# Set by Workers Builds, never locally. site/scripts/hosted-build.sh exports one
# of these as PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: the production key on the
# production branch, the development key on every other branch.
# CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY_PRODUCTION=
# CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY_DEVELOPMENT=

# ==== Local development only =================================================

# Optional. Where the site's Sign in links go. Unset, they go to
# https://my.crosstune.app. `just dev` sets it to the local app.
# PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
